  "document": "Hakuna Matata (song)\n\"Hakuna Matata\" is a song from Disney's 32nd animated feature \"The Lion King\". The song is based on Timon and Pumbaa's catchphrase in the movie, \"Hakuna matata\", which is a Swahili phrase; it means 'no worries'. It is characterized by its simple 4/4 time, upbeat message and catchy lyrics."
